# SWR-11033 Click Tracking - https://salesmsg.atlassian.net/browse/SWR-11033

name: click-tracking
description: Click tracking analytics - the link grid, one link's detail page, and the sources view
target: salesmessage
intro: Click tracking | See who clicks the links you send
outro: Thanks for watching | Analytics > Click tracking

Steps:
Log in and open Analytics from the left navigation
Confirm the menu carries "Click tracking" with "Overview" and "Sources" beneath it
Select "Overview"
Confirm the grid lists one row per delivered short link
Point out the four figures on a row: Sent, Clicks, Unique clicks and Unique click rate
Search for the prepared link by its short code
Confirm one row is returned
Select the row
Confirm the page header shows the destination with the short link beneath it
Confirm five tiles: Total sent, Total clicks, Unique clicks, Unique click rate and Credits per click
Observe the two charts below the tiles: Countries and Device type
Hover one country segment and confirm the tooltip names the country and its clicks
Open the "Usage" tab
Confirm one row per source that delivered the link, each with its own figures
Open the "Contacts" tab
Confirm the list shows who received the link and when
Select "Sources" in the left navigation and confirm four tiles above one row per source record
